WEBVTT

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:10.160
The magician who came from the netherworld to the human world, Uma.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.620
The vampire girl, Pachira.

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:14.720
The werewolf girl, Liru.

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:16.120
The cyborg, Aiko.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.550
Each of the four are "princesses," of sorts.

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:25.190
Unknown to humans, they live together in a makeshift home in a tree.

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:29.960
Because of their inexperience, in their first week...

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:33.780
Liru was almost shot with silver bullets by a hunter,

00:00:34.650 --> 00:00:36.140
Pachira was turned into ash,

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:40.570
Aiko was infected by a virus,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.300
and Uma exposed her breasts in public.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.020
Right after all these troubles occured is where we start our story.

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:52.070
Well then, what's today's story?

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:04.340
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:00:53.620 --> 00:01:04.340
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:21.350
yobidashitaru sonata e to

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:21.350
Thou, who hast here summoned the likes of me,

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:25.950
michibikareshi mi wo

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:25.950
Bestow thou me guidance from thine own body.

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.800
sashidasu wa senketsu no

00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:31.800
Hark as this fresh blood from my fingertips flows,

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:36.970
yubisaki no akashi

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:36.970
As proof of our contract: Our destiny --

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:48.050
hikari no kami mo azamuku chikai

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:48.050
A vow to betray even the gods of Light.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:58.280
mayakashi no izanai ni kotae tamae

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:58.280
Bewitched summoned being, entreat thou me thy reply.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:08.780
ochiru kogareru inochi wo toshite seiyaku no gi wo

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:08.780
As I plummet, I yearn for thee.
Swear to me thy very life.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:19.570
mune no kusabi ni tamuke no sanka shinen no chi e

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:19.570
Kiss the cleft of thy breast with my hesitant praise,
As we fall to earth to live the rest of our days.

00:02:37.750 --> 00:02:41.400
Ugh... I'm starving.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:04.070
Panties... Pa-PANTIES!

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.880
Eww! Quit it!

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.320
THIS SUCKS!

00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:12.100
The First Spell is an Easy Trap

00:03:08.390 --> 00:03:12.100
Pokaan ~ 1

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:27.150
Hello?

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:29.430
He's sound asleep!

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:34.070
Well then, time to dig in!

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:42.160
Yuuuck! What the heck is this?

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:47.660
Holy water I received from the church!

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.420
Madam! I'll immediately retrieve some medicine!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.310
Holy... Holy water? No way!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:15.770
This is perfect. Thanks to you, the scientific world that cast me out will now have proof!

00:04:16.170 --> 00:04:20.820
Scientific world? Proof? Huh? Who are you?

00:04:21.300 --> 00:04:22.280
Me?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:28.970
My name is Super Doctor K-ko, Researcher of the Supernatural!

00:04:28.970 --> 00:04:30.790
Anyone in the field would know me!

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:35.400
It appears as though you have fallen perfectly into my trap.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.900
Trap?

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:37.840
Oh, this...

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:43.220
With this, I can prove my hypothesis that female draculas exist.

00:04:43.220 --> 00:04:46.340
The existence of male draculas has been already been proven in my thesis!

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:01.600
Oh no, what should we do?

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.860
What should we do? We have to rescue her, of course!

00:05:04.890 --> 00:05:06.570
Will you be okay all alone?

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:15.080
Oh, of course! I'll be back in just a minute!

00:05:23.110 --> 00:05:23.970
Yo.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:27.510
L-Liru! What're you doing here?

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:32.040
Hm... You're not being very honest. You must be delighted that I'm here!

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:35.870
Whatever, just get me out of this trap.

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:38.750
Hm? What's the matter?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.020
Hurry up and get me out!

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:44.030
Do you want me to bow down to you or something?

00:05:45.510 --> 00:05:46.900
This smell...

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.430
Could it be?

00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:50.780
Hey, where are you going?!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.290
YAAAY!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:55.540
I-i-it really is!

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.790
This smell is Matsuzaka beef!

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.880
It looks like I've caught something else in my trap!

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:11.720
This time it looks like I've caught a werewolf.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:17.720
This is wonderful... Thanks to you, the scientific world that cast me out will now have proof!

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:20.730
Scientific world? Proof?

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:24.210
I'm a researcher of the supernatural.

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:27.760
It appears as though you've fallen into my trap.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:31.040
My hypothesis that female werewolves exist in addition to their already

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:33.200
discovered male counterparts was correct.

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.830
Huh? Um... Researcher of the supernatural?

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.210
Wait! More importantly, let me out of this cell!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:44.030
Cell? No, that's just a cage.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:48.420
You should be able to simply lift it up. If you're a regular human, that is.

00:06:50.590 --> 00:06:57.040
However, it may prove difficult for a female werewolf like yourself, because that cage is made of silver bars!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.760
Oh no! Liru-sama, too?

00:07:12.270 --> 00:07:14.950
I understand. I'll go!

00:07:21.490 --> 00:07:25.630
Capturing two perfect samples in one night...

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:33.820
With this, all that's left is to capture a Frankenstein-like female cyborg!

00:07:33.820 --> 00:07:38.140
I have a feeling the night is far from over!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.080
She's here!

00:08:01.570 --> 00:08:03.470
Please, do come in!

00:08:04.210 --> 00:08:06.520
Come now, we've been waiting for you!

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.840
Oh, thank you. Good evening.

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:19.930
No! Don't!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:23.560
Don't... Don't...

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:29.730
Wow, when it rains it pours. Catching them all! Sometimes I even surprise myself.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:36.270
Don't bother trying to talk.

00:08:36.270 --> 00:08:41.240
You, now paralyzed by this device, have proved my hypothesis about cyborgs.

00:08:41.890 --> 00:08:53.490
Now, I will be able to present these specimens to the scientific community, and take the world by storm!

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:01.290
Ai-chan? I'm so hungry.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.120
What? Hmm? Okay.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.510
Wh-who might you be?

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:06.230
Who?

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:12.860
I suddenly noticed the house was empty, and I'm all worn out from messing up my magic practice all day!

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:16.850
Magic? Witch? Um...

00:09:18.810 --> 00:09:23.860
Don't make me laugh. There's no such thing as a magician in this scientific world!

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:26.780
The existence of such things is impossible, my child.

00:09:26.780 --> 00:09:29.130
Hey! You're making fun of me!

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:34.970
Fine then. I'll show you my magic!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:37.380
Magic? More like sleight of hand.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.510
Puchii-n!

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:49.840
Spirits of thunder, lend your power so that I...

00:09:49.840 --> 00:09:51.250
Mukamukaa pucchin!

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:55.490
...may make the mean lady that made fun of me eat divine wrath!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:57.390
Honya!

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:08.830
What was that? Sure is a very cute form of divine punishment, isn't it?

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.460
This sucks...

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.560
Why don't you just give it up...

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:25.980
Th-this is!

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:29.060
Nature spirits of the lawn, lend me your power!

00:10:29.060 --> 00:10:32.470
Mukamukaa pucchin! Mukamukaa pucchin!

00:10:32.470 --> 00:10:37.990
This time I'll REALLY make that laughing woman over there PAY!

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:47.130
N-n-no panties! Hell yeah!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:48.500
Hong?

00:10:57.270 --> 00:10:58.370
Dead.

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:02.170
Ai-chan?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:24.210
You're so mean... Wearing my panties! Give them back!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:29.290
Hey, you shouldn't worry about it! The laundry hasn't even dried yet!

00:11:30.360 --> 00:11:34.000
And anyway, you should at least thank me for saving you!

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:37.900
No way... That's so mean!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.370
Fine... Thank you...

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.190
Now give me my panties back!

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:53.690
A lazy afternoon...

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:36.360
The next day

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:32.490
Pokaan ~ 2

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:32.490
The Afternoon Spell is a Red Cap!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:39.270
Everyone, we're having a meeting!

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:40.810
What's the matter?

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.030
What's up?

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.990
Guys, I bet none of you know about this!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:59.980
Every afternoon, a red vehicle comes around and delivers something into each house's box!

00:14:59.980 --> 00:15:02.690
Now that you mention it, I do see that sometimes.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:05.830
Why don't we ever get anything?

00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:08.550
Hey, hey, isn't that bad?

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.900
Are you talking about the postal service?

00:15:10.900 --> 00:15:12.370
Oh, that.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:15.600
Ah, so it's called the "postal service."

00:15:18.610 --> 00:15:24.560
Oh, the postal service. I think I've heard of it. The postal service...

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:26.310
So, what is it?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:34.870
Well... It's nothing to get worked up about. Right, Liru?

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:36.330
Yeah.

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:42.990
Anyway, Uma, if something like this comes up again, please don't disturb my sleep.

00:15:42.990 --> 00:15:44.420
Hey, wait!

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:48.580
If you want to get something, put a mailbox outside the house!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.580
Um...

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.380
Let's make one, Uma-san!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:05.970
You want mail, don't you? In that case, let's start with the box. We'll probably recieve some wonderful mail!

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:08.890
Yeah!

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:16.840
I did it! Look, look! This is where my mail is going to go!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:17.780
It's so stylish!

00:16:18.710 --> 00:16:22.790
But... There's nowhere to put in or take out the mail.

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:31.800
This'll do, right?

00:16:34.300 --> 00:16:35.960
Ai-chan, look!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:47.040
As long as mail can go in and out, it doesn't matter, does it?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.570
Ai-chan, you're too slow.

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.830
It's done!

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:03.010
It's so cool...

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.300
I win!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:17.340
The next day···

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.750
It's here!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.860
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:44.500
No way! Why?

00:17:46.350 --> 00:17:48.880
Maybe it didn't stand out enough.

00:17:53.550 --> 00:17:56.750
Alright, I'm going to make an even cooler mailbox this time!

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:58.810
Let's try our best, Uma-san!

00:17:59.700 --> 00:18:01.100
How is this?

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.390
That's a jack-in-the-box!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:07.740
Then... How about THIS?

00:18:08.220 --> 00:18:10.640
That's a microwave!

00:18:11.670 --> 00:18:13.500
Grr... How about this?

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:16.900
Please don't eat me!

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:47.270
What the hell are they doing?

00:18:58.680 --> 00:19:00.240
Excuse me...

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:06.240
How would you feel about giving <i>that</i> to me?

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:08.500
I refuse!

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:17.510
Having lots of mail boxes doesn't work, stopping him in the middle of the road doesn't work.

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:22.910
If those failed, just what can we do? Think of something!

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:29.020
You're a witch. Can't you use your magic somehow?

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:51.460
Like the expanding front of blooming cherry blossoms in Spring brings happiness and joy, come to me, mail!

00:19:54.610 --> 00:19:55.960
I understand now...

00:19:56.820 --> 00:20:01.000
Pansies on my Veranda-chan, you want water, don't you?!

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:02.470
Huh?

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:06.470
It's no use.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:14.730
Pachi-chan, why don't you just suck his blood and make him your servant?

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.990
Well... He's not really my type...

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.200
Can't you ignore that in this situation?

00:20:23.680 --> 00:20:26.740
What? You really want me to bite <i>that</i> neck?

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.390
If it was me, I'd definitely refuse.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.180
Time to eat~

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.430
This is the smell of Rairai Restaurant's garlic special!

00:21:04.900 --> 00:21:06.790
All we have left is Ai-chan.

00:21:08.860 --> 00:21:10.820
What should I do?

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:12.580
The question is, what CAN you do?

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:19.350
Hm? Well, I'm pretty good at repairing appliances and stuff.

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:24.550
But if you put me on the spot, I might freeze up...

00:21:27.910 --> 00:21:31.110
That aside, why aren't you helping out?

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:36.540
That's unfair! What have you been reading this whole time?

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:40.110
Oh, a letter from my friends.

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.110
A letter?

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:44.570
Yeah, I got it in the mail.

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:49.250
Apparently, there's a big Japanese food craze in Texas.

00:21:49.250 --> 00:21:52.070
They asked if they could come play with us next time they're in town.

00:21:54.820 --> 00:21:57.830
H-hey, what's wrong with you guys?

00:22:04.490 --> 00:22:08.340
It's already late at night, so good night.

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:28.100
atashi janai to shinjikomimasu

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:29.520
I really don't believe that I am here.

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:31.520
Shippai

00:22:29.600 --> 00:22:31.520
failed.

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:38.340
gyakugire shichaimashou?

00:22:33.680 --> 00:22:38.340
Why don't I just be an idiot instead?

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:46.520
san-kyuu wa renkinjutsu

00:22:39.340 --> 00:22:46.520
My alchemy is third rate.

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:53.930
shuuren datoka mendokusai desu

00:22:46.520 --> 00:22:53.930
Studying and that is just a pain in the neck.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.520
dan`i shuutoku

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.520
Getting grades

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:05.590
chokan desu denpa desuuu

00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:05.590
is instinct. It's something that's transmitted.

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:06.870
somirawa ramirami

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:06.870
Somirawa ramirami

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:08.470
ima yo ima da wa

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:08.470
Now! Now's the time!

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:11.170
YARU KI ZERO

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:11.170
I have zero willpower.

00:23:11.170 --> 00:23:13.460
ma ma ma makimoki nukunuku

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:16.970
purunrun kanshoku raperape howahowa

00:23:13.460 --> 00:23:16.970
Purunrun kanshoku raperape howahowa

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:23.810
gion wa aru imi koi no jumon

00:23:16.970 --> 00:23:23.810
These words have a special meaning. They're a love spell!

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.020
pa pa pa paparun munemune

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.020
Pa pa pa paparun munemune

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:30.020
uutori yuusabi petapeta noki noki

00:23:26.020 --> 00:23:30.030
uutori yuusabi petapeta noki noki

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:34.480
kankakuteki na atashi de GO!

00:23:30.030 --> 00:23:34.480
Go out with someone who's more sensitive, me!

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:41.390
Next Pokaan···

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:41.390
What's the best way to make a preview for a comedy?

00:23:41.390 --> 00:23:43.860
Next Pokaan···

00:23:41.570 --> 00:23:45.350
Every morning, cries of despair cause all sort of trouble!

00:23:43.860 --> 00:23:49.130
Next Pokaan···

00:23:46.370 --> 00:23:48.390
I can't use AAAA ?
